ality of the dataset. The first principal component is \n<div id=\"selectList-290907-0\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame\" id=\"selectListFrame-290907-0\" style=\"width: 211px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">&nbsp;<span class=\"selectListSelectedText\"></span></div><div class=\"selectListOptions\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">the direction in feature space</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">the datapoint</div></div></div> \nwith the \n<div id=\"selectList-290907-1\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame\" id=\"selectListFrame-290907-1\" style=\"width: 51px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">&nbsp;<span class=\"selectListSelectedText\"></span></div><div class=\"selectListOptions\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">most</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">least</div></div></div> \nvariance.</div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\"></div></div></div>",
